1
00:00:00,251 --> 00:00:03,421
(Raj:)Now I know how
all those army wives feel.

2
00:00:03,421 --> 00:00:05,821
(Howard:)Would you stop?

3
00:00:05,823 --> 00:00:07,953
(Howard:)We're just gonna be on
the other side of campus.

4
00:00:07,959 --> 00:00:10,589
(Raj:)And right here.

5
00:00:10,594 --> 00:00:14,964
(Howard:)You are a deeply silly man.

6
00:00:16,133 --> 00:00:18,663
(Raj:)He is so afraid of his feelings.

7
00:00:23,607 --> 00:00:24,967
(Penny:)Oh, hi.

8
00:00:24,988 --> 00:00:26,438
(Bernadette:)Got a minute?

9
00:00:26,444 --> 00:00:28,944
(Penny:)Yeah, come on in.

10
00:00:29,981 --> 00:00:32,081
(Bernadette:)I just wanted to apologize.

11
00:00:32,083 --> 00:00:34,483
(Bernadette:)I know what you did
was an accident.

12
00:00:34,485 --> 00:00:37,655
(Penny:)Oh, thank you,
and I'm sorry I lied about it.

13
00:00:37,655 --> 00:00:39,925
(Bernadette:)For what it's worth,
you're a great liar.

14
00:00:39,924 --> 00:00:41,994
(Penny:)Oh, that's what Amy said.

15
00:00:41,993 --> 00:00:44,623
(Penny:)So what's going on with
the research project?

16
00:00:44,628 --> 00:00:46,928
(Penny:)Are they gonna
let you run it?

17
00:00:46,931 --> 00:00:49,101
(Bernadette:)Well, my boss said
he hadn't decided yet,

18
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:51,970
(Bernadette:)so I gently reminded him
that he's an old rich white guy,

19
00:00:51,969 --> 00:00:53,639
(Bernadette:)and I'm a sweet
little pregnant lady

20
00:00:53,637 --> 00:00:56,537
(Bernadette:)who's not afraid to cry
in front of a jury.

21
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:59,270
(Penny:)You threatened to sue?

